  "details": "If I attach VRC_DataStorage component to a GameObject, the VRC_Trigger components attached to the GameObject do not work.\n \nThis problem have occured since VRChat 2020.1.1p3 (2020-04-17) and it had not occured in VRChat 2020.1.1p2 or previous.\n \nError log:\n2020.04.21 00:25:05 Error      -  [VRC_TriggerInternal] Unnamed:OnInteract deferred b/c view id\n \nDemo scene:\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/511077066628661271/701815154555355189/DataStorage-break-Trigger.unitypackage\nDemo world:\nhttps://www.vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_846ee5b7-c657-45d6-aa80-db4f5e62e09b",
